                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 font-coming-soon-regular">Peasant</h3>
                            <p class="font-coming-soon-regular text-sm line-clamp-8 overflow-hidden">A peasant is traditionally a low-status farmer or agricultural laborer who works on a small plot of land, often in rural areas. Historically, peasants were common in feudal societies, where they worked the land for landlords or noble classes in exchange for protection or a place to live.</p>
                        </div>
