                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 font-coming-soon-regular">Goat</h3>
                            <p class="font-coming-soon-regular text-sm line-clamp-8 overflow-hidden">A goat is a domesticated ruminant animal belonging to the species Capra hircus. It is known for its agility, adaptability, and hardiness, thriving in diverse environments, from mountains to grasslands. Goats have been domesticated for thousands of years and are valued for their milk, meat, wool, and hides.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
