                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 font-coming-soon-regular">Circus Monkey</h3>
                            <p class="font-coming-soon-regular text-sm line-clamp-8 overflow-hidden">A circus monkey is a trained primate, usually a small or medium-sized species like capuchins or macaques, that performs tricks and routines in a circus or street performance. These monkeys are often trained to do acrobatics, ride bicycles, wear costumes, or interact with props to entertain audiences.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
