                            <p class="font-coming-soon-regular text-sm line-clamp-8 overflow-hidden">A dog (Canis lupus familiaris) is a domesticated mammal and one of the most loyal and intelligent animals known to humans. Descended from wolves, dogs have been bred for thousands of years for various purposes, including companionship, hunting, herding, and protection.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
