                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 font-coming-soon-regular">Monky</h3>
                            <p class="font-coming-soon-regular text-sm line-clamp-8 overflow-hidden">A monkey is intelligence, agility, and social behavior. Monkeys are found in tropical and subtropical regions around the world and are classified into two main groups: New World monkeys, which live in South and Central America, and Old World monkeys, Africa and Asia.</p>
                        </div>
